# Build trees, UART captures and fetched test suites and references
# (design.md §15.2, §15.4).
build/
out/
test/suites/
reference/

# The CoCo's ROMs are copyrighted and not distributed
# (design.md §12.1, D10): roms/ is a staging area, and only its README is
# in git.
roms/*
!roms/README.md

# The owner's cartridges, tapes and discs, for the host tests that load
# real software (design.md §15.3): not ours to distribute either.
media/*
!media/README.md

.DS_Store
